# Scoped ignore for the admin-UI image. BuildKit reads `<dockerfile>.dockerignore`
# (here infra/docker/ui.Dockerfile.dockerignore), so this applies only to the UI
# build — not the api/ray images that share the repo-root build context.
#
# Patterns are relative to the build context (repo root, per compose `context: ../..`).
# Keeping the host's node_modules out of the context is the point: otherwise
# `COPY ui/ .` (after `npm ci`) overwrites the freshly-installed alpine/musl deps
# with host glibc/x64 binaries, breaking `npm run build` with a native-binary
# mismatch — which only reproduces on machines that ran `npm install` locally.
ui/node_modules
ui/dist
ui/.env
ui/.env.*
